{"page":78,"width":1836,"height":2431,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"02","words":[{"text":"02","x":832,"y":632,"width":312,"height":232}]},{"text":"Chapter","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":392,"y":708,"width":231,"height":57}]},{"text":"人태","words":[{"text":"人태","x":831,"y":1140,"width":165,"height":55}]},{"text":"배열과 리스트는 데이터의 입/출력이 자우롭습니다. 데이","words":[{"text":"배열과","x":836,"y":1322,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"리스트는","x":943,"y":1324,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"데이터의","x":1074,"y":1323,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"입/출력이","x":1209,"y":1324,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"자우롭습니다.","x":1354,"y":1327,"width":188,"height":36},{"text":"데이","x":1558,"y":1329,"width":57,"height":34}]},{"text":"터 입/출력에 \u0027자유라는 개념이 끼어드니 뭔가 이상하지","words":[{"text":"터","x":838,"y":1390,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"입/출력에","x":884,"y":1391,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"\u0027자유라는","x":1033,"y":1391,"width":141,"height":35},{"text":"개념이","x":1188,"y":1392,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"끼어드니","x":1292,"y":1393,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"뭔가","x":1427,"y":1394,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"이상하지","x":1501,"y":1394,"width":118,"height":35}]},{"text":"요? 우리가 앞으로 만날 자료구조들은 엄격한 데이터 입/","words":[{"text":"요?","x":837,"y":1460,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"우리가","x":899,"y":1459,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"앞으로","x":1004,"y":1459,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"만날","x":1107,"y":1459,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"자료구조들은","x":1182,"y":1459,"width":185,"height":36},{"text":"엄격한","x":1378,"y":1461,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":1480,"y":1460,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"입/","x":1584,"y":1461,"width":43,"height":35}]},{"text":"출력 규칙을 가지고 있습니다. 입/출력 규칙만으로도 종","words":[{"text":"출력","x":838,"y":1528,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"규칙을","x":916,"y":1528,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"가지고","x":1025,"y":1528,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"있습니다.","x":1134,"y":1527,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"입/출력","x":1284,"y":1528,"width":103,"height":34},{"text":"규칙만으로도","x":1403,"y":1528,"width":187,"height":35},{"text":"종","x":1601,"y":1530,"width":34,"height":34}]},{"text":"종 우용한 쓰임새를 만들 수 있는데요. 이번에 다를 스택","words":[{"text":"종","x":839,"y":1598,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"우용한","x":885,"y":1597,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"쓰임새를","x":993,"y":1597,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"만들","x":1131,"y":1596,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1208,"y":1597,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있는데요.","x":1254,"y":1596,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"이번에","x":1401,"y":1597,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"다를","x":1504,"y":1597,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"스택","x":1575,"y":1596,"width":59,"height":35}]},{"text":"이 그런 경우에 해당합니다. 더 자세한 내용은 본문에서 이","words":[{"text":"이","x":843,"y":1667,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"그런","x":884,"y":1667,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"경우에","x":958,"y":1667,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"해당합니다.","x":1059,"y":1665,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"더","x":1234,"y":1666,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"자세한","x":1274,"y":1665,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"내용은","x":1374,"y":1665,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"본문에서","x":1474,"y":1664,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":1607,"y":1664,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"야기하겠습니다. 저를 따라서 다음 페이지로 넘어오세의","words":[{"text":"야기하겠습니다.","x":844,"y":1737,"width":230,"height":38},{"text":"저를","x":1089,"y":1736,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":1161,"y":1735,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"다음","x":1263,"y":1734,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"페이지로","x":1336,"y":1734,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"넘어오세의","x":1467,"y":1732,"width":157,"height":36}]}]}